{"id": "EUVD-2026-59470", "enisaUuid": "ab46f2d7-a56a-3545-b00d-e32e05d2db28", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: mt76: mt7996: Fix possible token leak in mt7996_tx_prepare_skb()\n\nIf link_conf or link_sta lookup fails in mt7996_tx_prepare_skb routine,\nmt7996 driver leaks an already allocated tx token. Fix the issue\nreleasing the token in case of error.", "datePublished": "2026-08-15T05:58:18", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T18:55:33", "baseScore": 8.8, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/06e65d6cf80490bc0457d339595d1ed5a89e8899", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fa0e9aa92a7bc97fc42014c5efaaf1278fa92723", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/831074096d0450308357271fc0ffd3f600a2487e"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-74323", "GHSA-34gf-qwwx-pv6w"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.38, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4b2f1e69-f1df-3b36-8a97-d6ca6f1f6e38", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2"}, {"id": "7ccbee41-4e43-3fb1-a7e4-08c32e1f65f6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.1.5"}, {"id": "965dbe4f-3ef6-38ae-9c0a-c5f4759f0f8a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7ef0c7ad735b0c38140259519a3f165bee2b857c <831074096d0450308357271fc0ffd3f600a2487e"}, {"id": "9ba5b426-48cc-3b45-9029-4b0fa6ce9de5", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7ef0c7ad735b0c38140259519a3f165bee2b857c <06e65d6cf80490bc0457d339595d1ed5a89e8899"}, {"id": "b3a9ad60-9fe2-3219-ad1f-64fd82c036db", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7ef0c7ad735b0c38140259519a3f165bee2b857c <fa0e9aa92a7bc97fc42014c5efaaf1278fa92723"}, {"id": "bd1cf56a-66ed-3873-959e-5e584736d146", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_versio